<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the third day of Sheffield Shield matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>In Adelaide: Victoria 241 (Ian Harvey 73) and 46 for two; South Australia 216 and 449 for nine declared (Darren Lehmann 167, Brad Young 76 not out, Martin Faull 54, Jamie Siddons 51).</p>
<p>In Hobart: Tasmania 408 (Ricky Ponting 159) and 207 for four (Jamie Cox 74, Michael DiVenuto 56); Queensland 283 (Geoff Foley 77, Matthew Mott 74).</p>
